2. Where the Minister of Patriots and Veterans Affairs has determined, before this Decree enters into force, that a person falls under Article 4 (1) 3 of the Act on the Honorable Treatment of and Support for Persons of Distinguished Service to the State concerning soldiers or police officers killed in action, or under Article 4 (1) 5 of that Act concerning soldiers or police officers killed in the line of duty, or is a bereaved family member or family member thereof, pursuant to Article 6 (3) of that Act.
